    "text": {
     "en": "We all like to eat and drink different things. Some foods are sweet, some sour, some spicy and some bitter.\nWe eat fruits, vegetables, rice, dal and roti. We drink milk, lassi or juice.\nWhy do we need to eat and drink? Talk to elders about it.\nWe eat to get energy, to grow and to stay healthy.\nChhappan bhog is a special festival food with 56 dishes with six tastes: sweet, spicy, astringent, sour, salty and bitter."
